<p>Conjure a shield of ice around you that can absorb a total of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">281, 378, 453, 517, 574</acronym> damage.</p><p>Anytime it does it retaliates by sending a bolt of ice at the attacker, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">35, 47, 56, 64, 71</acronym> cold damage (this can only happen once per turn per creature).</p><p>When you are above 1 life it only affects 66.6% of the damage, letting through the rest.</p><p>When you are under 1 life it affects 100% of the damage and also reduces the damage of critical hits by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 18%, 26%, 33%, 40%.</acronym></p><p>10 turns after leaving combat the shield will consume its mana and soul cost again to fully regenerate if needed. if that cost can not be matched, it unsustains.</p><p>The shield strength will increase with your Spellpower.</p>